I stand in front of the office.
I unlock my bicycle.
It is just after half past four.
I ride through the streets.
The evening is cool.
The streets are very busy.
Many people are riding home.
I gladly ride this route.
I want to meet new people in the city.
A sports club is perfect for that.
After a short ride, I am there.
I can already see the large sports hall.
The building is very modern.
I brake and get off.
Many bicycles are already standing here.
I park my bicycle.
I pick up my backpack.
Then I walk to the entrance.
